## Agent commands

- `/planora-next` — implement and verify exactly one dependency-ready TODO item.
- `/planora-change` — revise product behavior and synchronize the planning package before implementation.
- `/feature` — implement an explicitly scoped feature outside the ordered Planora-next flow.
- `/bug` — diagnose and repair a defect.
- `/chore` — perform behavior-preserving maintenance.
- `/e2e-tester <spec-path>` — run a prepared browser E2E spec.

